{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35737","headline":"寄修睦上人 · 李咸用","name":"寄修睦上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"衣服田方无内客，一入庐云断消息。\n应爲山中胜概偏，惠持惠远多踪迹。\n寻阳有个虚舟子，相忆由来无一事。\n江边月色到岩前，此际心情必相似。\n似不似，寄数字。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35737.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35737","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}